    "detailed_description": "EXTREME STUNTS Here you can ride different models of ATVs and perform the most incredible stunts. UNIQUE &quot;Yufik&quot;, &quot;Raptor&quot;, &quot;Banshee&quot;, Electric bikes are waiting for you! REAL damage, UNREAL speed!<br />\r\nIn the quadric simulator, you can practice derby in different places of the city, motocross with trampolines, in a crazy arena. Perform tricks to get the maximum reward. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEXPLORE BEAUTIFUL LOCATIONS around the world. Jump from 20-meter trampolines, slide off mini-ramps, rush through forests and stormy rivers, through endless fields or hills, race through mountains. Try an off-road game with amazing gameplay, get stuck in mud or sand, drive through obstacles. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCREATE your ATV, improve its performance in the garage, play with your friends online!",
    "about_the_game": "EXTREME STUNTS Here you can ride different models of ATVs and perform the most incredible stunts. UNIQUE &quot;Yufik&quot;, &quot;Raptor&quot;, &quot;Banshee&quot;, Electric bikes are waiting for you! REAL damage, UNREAL speed!<br />\r\nIn the quadric simulator, you can practice derby in different places of the city, motocross with trampolines, in a crazy arena. Perform tricks to get the maximum reward. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEXPLORE BEAUTIFUL LOCATIONS around the world. Jump from 20-meter trampolines, slide off mini-ramps, rush through forests and stormy rivers, through endless fields or hills, race through mountains. Try an off-road game with amazing gameplay, get stuck in mud or sand, drive through obstacles. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCREATE your ATV, improve its performance in the garage, play with your friends online!",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the world of quad bike games with real physics. This cool ATV racing game will not leave anyone indifferent! Ride bikes through realistic locations, compete and have fun! Play with your friends online!",
